  "description": "Lee Seung-Yeon has had a crush on his childhood friend, Gong Ji-Hyeok, for a long time. One day, he hears someone say that a person can be happy for a lifetime with just a single memory. Seung-Yeon wants to create that one memory with Ji-Hyeok, a memory he’ll cherish forever, but at the same time, he’s terrified that they’ll eventually part ways and become strangers…\n\n*“Can you give me just one day of your life?”*\n\nIn the end, Seung-Yeon asks Ji-Hyeok to date him for just one day.\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
